      "body": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Ozone is a powerful oxidizing agent. It is non-toxic in small concentrations, but above 100 parts per million (ppm), it is toxic. It is harmful to humans, plants and other materials i.e., rubber, fabric dyes, and durability and appearance of paints."
          }
